:: Ben Hang Out End Early Low Fun [nobr]

As you and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ben</span> finish your latest conversation, you realize the time and tell him you have to go. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ben</span>’s previous smile instantly fades. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“You have to-?”</span> He pauses, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Already? But it isn’t even-”</span> He pauses, not wanting to sound too upset. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Alright. Well… I guess I’ll see you at school?”</span> He gives a poor attempt at a smile, obviously expecting a bit more out of your hang out session and upset it has ended early. <span style="color:LightCoral">You get the idea he doesn’t get asked to hang out often and is a little disappointed.</span> <br>

