]>>
<<ad _ad>>

You apologize to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ben</span> for ending early, but he waves his hand and says it’s alright. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“It’s fine. I get it. I should probably be heading home too. Have some chores and homework left to do anyway, so I’m all set for the rest of the night. I’ll… I’ll see you later!”</span> <span style="color:LightCoral"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ben</span> quickly hurries off, trying his best not to sound too upset.</span> <br>
<<socialChange "Ben" -3>>
