:: Ben Hang Out End Early High Fun [nobr]

As you and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ben</span> finish a riveting conversation that only the two of you could enjoy to this extent, you sigh sadly and inform the boy you have to leave. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh, already?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ben</span> says, seemingly surprised you’d have to leave this early. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Early curfew or-”</span> He pauses, blushing, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Sorry! Not my place to ask. It’s fine.”</span> <span style="color:LightGreen">He smiles, clearly having enjoyed the time with you.</span> <br>

